=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250926155358&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diabolic_Imp_349d51.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  The Imperor.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Poke! Poke! &lt;chuckle&gt;</li><li>Let me tickle you with my trident!</li><li>I am so bad today</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The Imperor is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Diabolic%20Imp\">Diabolic Imp</a> boss. It was killed first time on Solera, later on Pacera and Refugia.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"d6fb1dadc91acf8358ba3e700f9c9ee0\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:173px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Imperor2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:162px; width:185px; top:4.5px;\"><img alt=\"The Imperor's Trident on Refugia.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\" on .\" height=\"171\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Imperor2_f15aaa.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Imperor2.png (346 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The Imperor's Trident on Refugia.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:173px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Imperor-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:171px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The Imperor in action on Harmonia.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The Imperor in action on .\" height=\"171\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Imperor_cbb155.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Imperor.jpg (113 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The Imperor in action on Harmonia.</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-500)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Summons</span> (1-2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Diabolic%20Imp\">Diabolic Imp</a>)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a></span> (100-800)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Fire Hit</span> (100-800)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Fire Wave</span> (?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Missing Element\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"13\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Question_Mark_Icon_e8125e.png\" width=\"8\"/></span></span> Some kind of energy bomb around itself with unknown effect</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data